# CI smoke test only (.github/workflows/ci.yml, job "images"). Dummy but
# well-formed values: nothing here is a real credential, and no service is
# contacted. Production gating is unchanged (NODE_ENV=production,
# AUTH_MODE=clerk): the smoke test checks /api/health and /api/ready, which
# do not use Clerk or the object store.
